\newlabel{fig:rh_app_murphy}{{4}{60}{Murphy diagram (elementary scores) for the model set (\rhappModelSetN {} forecasts: earlier draft \rhappModelSetPaper , pooled intraday linear \rhappModelSetPooledLin , closing-interval linear \rhappModelSetPerBarLin , closing-interval trees \rhappModelSetPerBarTrees ), over the \rhappNdays {} trading days of the out-of-sample period. Panel (a): mean elementary score $\overline {\mathrm {ES}}_\theta $ \citep {Ehm2016} at each of \rhappMurphyNc {} thresholds $\theta $, in units of the 15:30 implied variance, log scale (lower is better); $\theta = 1$ is the threshold used by the sign strategy, $q_t = \sign (\hat \sigma ^2_t - \mathrm {IV}^2_t)$, and QLIKE equals the integral of the elementary scores weighted by $\theta ^{-2}$ (Section~\ref {sec:rh_econ_measures}). Panel (b): each forecast's mean elementary score minus the model-set mean at the same $\theta $}{figure.caption.61}{}}
